<h3 class="heading-size-3" id="emblems">Emblems of Frost for Warlock DPS in Phase 4</h3>
<a class="icontiny q1" data-game="wow" data-type="currency" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/currency=341/emblem-of-frost">
<span>
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_misc_frostemblem_01.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Emblem of Frost</span></span></a> drop in <a href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/zone=4812/icecrown-citadel">
<span class="tinyicontxt">Icecrown Citadel</span></a> (25 per raid size) and in <a href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/zone=4603/vault-of-archavon">
<span class="tinyicontxt">Vault of Archavon</span></a> (2 per raid size), as well as being rewarded for the weekly raid quests (20) and the daily heroics (total of 35 per week). Overall, this results in a maximum of 109 per weekly reset. The most important pieces we can buy with <a class="icontiny q1" data-game="wow" data-type="currency" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/currency=341/emblem-of-frost">
<span>
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_misc_frostemblem_01.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Emblem of Frost</span></span></a> are pieces of <a href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item-set=-840/dark-covens-regalia">
<span class="tinyicontxt">Dark Coven's Regalia</span></a>. We need 310 to 345 <a class="icontiny q1" data-game="wow" data-type="currency" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/currency=341/emblem-of-frost">
<span>
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_misc_frostemblem_01.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Emblem of Frost</span></span></a> for the four-piece set depending on what items you get, or 405 for all five pieces. In other words, it will take 3 to 5 weeks excluding <a href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/zone=4603/vault-of-archavon">
<span class="tinyicontxt">Vault of Archavon</span></a> drops for the 251-item level version of Tier 10. Additionally, we can use the remaining <a class="icontiny q1" data-game="wow" data-type="currency" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/currency=341/emblem-of-frost">
<span>
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_misc_frostemblem_01.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Emblem of Frost</span></span></a> we get to update various item slots or get alternatives to play around with our hit rating. Once you have everything gear-related that you want, you can opt to spend any remaining <a class="icontiny q1" data-game="wow" data-type="currency" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/currency=341/emblem-of-frost">
<span>
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_misc_frostemblem_01.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Emblem of Frost</span></span></a> on <a class="q3 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=49908/primordial-saronite">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/spell_fire_felflamebreath.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Primordial Saronite</span></a>, the new crafting material that is used to create this phase's bind on equipped items. Note that <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=50240/dark-coven-gloves">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_gauntlets_88.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Dark Coven Gloves</span></a> and <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=50242/dark-coven-leggings">
