<h3 class="heading-size-3" id="shoulders">Shoulders</h3>For shoulders, it is a similar story compared to our helm slot. Ideally, we want to get <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=50244/dark-coven-shoulderpads">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_shoulder_114.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Dark Coven Shoulderpads</span></a> or any of the upgraded versions if possible. Coming from <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=47793/guldans-shoulderpads-of-triumph">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_shoulder_35.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Gul'dan's Shoulderpads of Triumph</span></a> it is worth noting that both shoulder pieces do not have any hit rating on them making it a relatively easy upgrade path. If you get shoulder drops such as <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=50643/shoulders-of-mercy-killing">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_shoulder_114.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Shoulders of Mercy Killing</span></a> out of <a href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/zone=4812/icecrown-citadel">
<span class="tinyicontxt">Icecrown Citadel</span></a> you will want to simulate whether it is worth it to break your Tier 9 to equip it, but eventually, you will want to get the 60 <a class="icontiny q1" data-game="wow" data-type="currency" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/currency=341/emblem-of-frost">
<span>
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_misc_frostemblem_01.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Emblem of Frost</span></span></a> for <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=50244/dark-coven-shoulderpads">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_shoulder_114.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Dark Coven Shoulderpads</span></a> and upgrade it. Note that all the drop shoulders also have hit rating on them and will require secondary item swaps to correct for your total hit chance.<div class="box">
<b>Shoulder Inscription</b>: <a class="icontiny" data-entity="spell" data-entity-has-icon="true" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/spell=61120/masters-inscription-of-the-storm">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_inscription_tradeskill01.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Master's Inscription of the Storm</span></a> (<a class="icontiny" data-game="wow" data-type="skill" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/skill=773/inscription">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_inscription_tradeskill01.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Inscription</span></a>) &gt; <a class="q7 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=50338/greater-inscription-of-the-storm">
