<h3 class="heading-size-3" id="back">Back</h3>All the cloaks from this phase and the previous one are incredibly close in terms of performance. It should not come as a surprise that the heroic versions of capes are the ones performing the best with <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=50668/greatcloak-of-the-turned-champion">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/item_icecrowncape.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Greatcloak of the Turned Champion</span></a> being the best of the best. However, those with <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=47554/lady-liadrins-conviction">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_misc_cape_18.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Lady Liadrin's Conviction</span></a> or the Horde counterpart are looking at an equally good cloak and might have already gotten it inside <a href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/zone=4722/trial-of-the-crusader">
<span class="tinyicontxt">Trial of the Crusader</span></a> in the previous phase. This should not be all too surprising since the difference between the heroic 25-man <a href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/zone=4722/trial-of-the-crusader">
<span class="tinyicontxt">Trial of the Crusader</span></a> and <a href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/zone=4812/icecrown-citadel">
<span class="tinyicontxt">Icecrown Citadel</span></a> cloaks are only 5 item levels. Whilst <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=50628/frostbinders-shredded-cape">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_misc_cape_16.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Frostbinder's Shredded Cape</span></a> is also great for us it ends up being the best in slot for Affliction and other casters, with there being greater options out there for us.<br/>
<br/>Small note about <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=51826/lich-wrappings">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_misc_cape_19.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Lich Wrappings</span></a> and <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=47452/shroud-of-displacement">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_misc_cape_18.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Shroud of Displacement</span></a> both are good options with hit rating on them. When you eventually upgrade your cloak however you will need to make sure you make up for the hit rating on some other slot instead since all the best cloaks in this phase do not have any hit rating on them.<div class="box">
<b>Cloak Enchant</b>:<a class="icontiny" data-entity="spell" data-entity-has-icon="true" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/spell=55642/lightweave-embroidery">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_misc_thread_01.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Lightweave Embroidery</span></a> (<a class="icontiny" data-game="wow" data-type="skill" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/skill=197/tailoring">
