<h3 class="heading-size-3" id="chest">Chest</h3>The difference in performance between a variation <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=50717/sanguine-silk-robes">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_chest_cloth_80.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Sanguine Silk Robes</span></a> and <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=51233/sanctified-dark-coven-robe">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_chest_cloth_77.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Sanctified Dark Coven Robe</span></a> is relative close, with the off-piece being the best. In the case of other specializations the Tier 10 chest ends up being better, opening up a possibility to prevent loot competition. This is mostly due to the high amount of spirit available on <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=50717/sanguine-silk-robes">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_chest_cloth_80.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Sanguine Silk Robes</span></a> which we benefit from significantly.<div class="box">
