<h3 class="heading-size-3" id="waist">Waist</h3>
<a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=50702/lingering-illness">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_belt_68.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Lingering Illness</span></a> with its spirit is the best belt we have available, <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=50613/crushing-coldwraith-belt">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_belt_64.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Crushing Coldwraith Belt</span></a> ends up being a great alternative. You trade in the spirit in favor of haste rating (in other words some more personal DPS but less raid contribution in the form of <a class="icontiny" data-entity="spell" data-entity-has-icon="true" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/spell=47240/demonic-pact">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/spell_shadow_demonicpact.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Demonic Pact</span></a>), however <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=50613/crushing-coldwraith-belt">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_belt_64.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Crushing Coldwraith Belt</span></a> is the technical best in slot for Affliction where we on paper have a better option with <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=50702/lingering-illness">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_belt_68.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Lingering Illness</span></a>. Note that all the best belts this phase do not have any hit rating on them.<div class="box">
<b>Waist Enchant</b>: <a class="q3 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=41611/eternal-belt-buckle">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_belt_36.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Eternal Belt Buckle</span></a> &amp; <a class="icontiny" data-entity="spell" data-entity-has-icon="true" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/spell=54793/frag-belt">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/trade_engineering.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Frag Belt</span></a> (<a class="icontiny" data-game="wow" data-type="skill" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/skill=202/engineering">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/trade_engineering.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Engineering</span></a>)</div>
