<h3 class="heading-size-3" id="legs">Legs</h3>Ideally we get a variation of <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=51232/sanctified-dark-coven-leggings">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_kilt_cloth_02.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Sanctified Dark Coven Leggings</span></a> so that we free up the chest slot of tier in order to equip  <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=50717/sanguine-silk-robes">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_chest_cloth_80.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Sanguine Silk Robes</span></a> instead. Note that if due to circumstances your are using the Tier 10 chest piece you could opt to make use of <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=50694/plaguebringers-stained-pants">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_kilt_cloth_02.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Plaguebringer's Stained Pants</span></a> which results in a bit more personal DPS at the cost of overall raid performance, and note that <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=50694/plaguebringers-stained-pants">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_kilt_cloth_02.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Plaguebringer's Stained Pants</span></a> is the best in slot option for other casters.<br/>
<br/>Alternatively, if you are high on hit rating already you could opt for either <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=49891/leggings-of-woven-death">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_pants_cloth_34.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Leggings of Woven Death</span></a> or <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=51882/kilt-of-untreated-wounds">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_kilt_cloth_02.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Kilt of Untreated Wounds</span></a> (with the caveat of using Tier 10 chest for the set bonus).<div class="box">
