<h2 class="heading-size-2" id="jewelry">Jewelry for Warlock DPS in Phase 4</h2>
<div class="pad"></div>
<h3 class="heading-size-3" id="neck">Neck</h3>Most necklaces can be considered as good <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=50658/amulet-of-the-silent-eulogy">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/item_icecrownnecklaced.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Amulet of the Silent Eulogy</span></a> and <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=50609/bone-sentinels-amulet">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_jewelry_necklace_53.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Bone Sentinel's Amulet</span></a> stand out as the best for Demonology depending on your hit rating requirements. <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=50658/amulet-of-the-silent-eulogy">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/item_icecrownnecklaced.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Amulet of the Silent Eulogy</span></a> is one of the better hit off-pieces for Demonology as it lets you take other off pieces with more spirit on them as a primary attribute, on the other hand if your hit requirements are already met <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=50609/bone-sentinels-amulet">
