<h3 class="heading-size-3" id="rings">Rings</h3>Like the previous Phase, we have many close worthwhile options instead of a clear winner combination. <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=50636/memory-of-malygos">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_jewelry_ring_40.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Memory of Malygos</span></a> combined with <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=50398/ashen-band-of-endless-destruction">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_jewelry_ring_83.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Ashen Band of Endless Destruction</span></a> which is rewarded for reaching exalted with <a href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/faction=1156/the-ashen-verdict">
<span class="tinyicontxt">The Ashen Verdict</span></a> form the absolute best combination. Either of these can easily be replaced with <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=50644/ring-of-maddening-whispers">
